pageType: content
background: { type: solid, color: "$paper" }
notes: |
  Slide 4: The Catalog Grows: Exponential Surge to ~390 Candidates.
  - Documents catalog statistics: GWTC-1 (11 events), GWTC-2 (50 events), GWTC-2.1 (58 events), GWTC-3 (90 events), and O4 preliminary alerts (~390 cumulative transients).
  - Explicitly states selection criteria: p_astro >= 0.5 or False Alarm Rate (FAR) < 1 yr^-1.
  - Distinguishes catalog facts (90 confirmed events in formal releases), visualization choices (cumulative stepped bars with alert distinction), astrophysical interpretations (cosmic merger rate density R_BBH ~ 16-38 Gpc^-3 yr^-1), and open questions (retention rate of preliminary O4 candidates upon offline reanalysis).
  - Outlines the matched-filter search pipeline stack (GstLAL, PyCBC, MBTA, cWB).
elements:
  # Left Rail
  - elementId: rail-bg
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [14, 24, 142, 484]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$cardBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  - elementId: rail-thumb-1
    elementType: image
    bounds: [18, 30, 134, 84]
    src: "assets/thumb_detectors.png"
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: rail-thumb-2
    elementType: image
    bounds: [18, 122, 134, 84]
    src: "assets/thumb_timeline.png"
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: rail-thumb-3
    elementType: image
    bounds: [18, 214, 134, 84]
    src: "assets/thumb_catalog.png"
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: rail-thumb-4
    elementType: image
    bounds: [18, 306, 134, 84]
    src: "assets/thumb_mass.png"
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: rail-divider
    elementType: line
    bounds: [168, 24, 1, 484]
    points: "0,0 0,484"
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  # Header
  - elementId: slide-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [185, 24, 475, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: "Catalog Population Multiplies by 35× to ~390 Candidates"

  - elementId: slide-category
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 27, 260, 18]
    content:
      style: "$category"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "03 · CATALOG GROWTH"

  - elementId: header-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [185, 58, 735, 1]
    points: "0,0 735,0"
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  # Center Area: Catalog Growth Matplotlib Chart
  - elementId: chart-catalog
    elementType: image
    bounds: [185, 70, 420, 235]
    src: "assets/catalog_growth.png"
    fit: { mode: contain }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  # Scientific Epistemology Distinction Box
  - elementId: dist-box
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [185, 315, 420, 125]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$highlightBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  - elementId: dist-txt
    elementType: text
    bounds: [193, 321, 404, 113]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      lineHeight: 1.3
      color: "$ink"
      text: |
        <b>[Catalog Fact]</b> 90 events confirmed in GWTC-1..3 at \( p_{\text{astro}} \ge 0.5 \); ~390 cumulative alerts in O1–O4 public database.<br/>
        <b>[Visualization Choice]</b> Stepped cumulative bar encoding; teal marks preliminary public alerts vs blue formal offline releases.<br/>
        <b>[Physical Interpretation]</b> Observed count scales with cosmic volume \( \propto D^3 \); implies \( \mathrm{R}_{\text{BBH}} \approx 16-38\text{ Gpc}^{-3}\text{ yr}^{-1} \).<br/>
        <b>[Open Question]</b> Fraction of marginal O4 public alerts that will survive rigorous offline calibration and glitch subtraction.

  # Right Sidebar
  - elementId: side-1-bg
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [625, 75, 295, 110]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$cardBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  - elementId: side-1-icon
    elementType: icon
    iconName: "fas:filter"
    bounds: [637, 85, 15, 15]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: side-1-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [658, 85, 250, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$muted"
      text: "MATCHED FILTERING"

  - elementId: side-1-box
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [637, 103, 271, 26]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$highlightBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: side-1-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 107, 261, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: |
        \( \rho(t) = 4 \int \tilde{s}(f)\,\tilde{h}^*(f)\,S_n^{-1}(f)\,e^{2\pi i f t}\,df \)

  - elementId: side-1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [637, 134, 271, 44]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9
      text: "GstLAL, PyCBC, and MBTA cross-correlate calibrated strain data against a discrete bank of ~10⁶ analytical relativistic template waveforms."

  - elementId: side-2-bg
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [625, 195, 295, 118]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$cardBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  - elementId: side-2-icon
    elementType: icon
    iconName: "fas:dice"
    bounds: [637, 205, 15, 15]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$teal" }

  - elementId: side-2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [658, 205, 250, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$muted"
      text: "SELECTION THRESHOLD"

  - elementId: side-2-box
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [637, 223, 271, 26]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$highlightBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: side-2-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 227, 261, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      bold: true
      color: "$teal"
      text: |
        \( p_{\text{astro}} = \Lambda_{\text{sig}} / (\Lambda_{\text{sig}} + \Lambda_{\text{noise}}) \ge 0.5 \)

  - elementId: side-2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [637, 254, 271, 52]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9
      text: "Poisson likelihood mixture model assigning candidate triggers an astrophysical probability. Candidates with FAR < 1 yr⁻¹ qualify for rapid circularization."

  - elementId: side-3-bg
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [625, 323, 295, 108]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$cardBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border" }

  - elementId: side-3-icon
    elementType: icon
    iconName: "fas:chart-simple"
    bounds: [637, 333, 15, 15]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }

  - elementId: side-3-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [658, 333, 250, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      bold: true
      color: "$muted"
      text: "COHERENT WAVEBURST"

  - elementId: side-3-box
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [637, 351, 271, 26]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$highlightBg" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$borderHair" }

  - elementId: side-3-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [642, 355, 261, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 8.5
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      text: |
        \( \text{cWB unmodeled search: } \text{SNR}_{\text{coherent}} \ge 8 \)

  - elementId: side-3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [637, 382, 271, 44]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9
      text: "Template-free wavelet decomposition detects exotic or highly eccentric signals (such as core-collapse supernovae or cosmic string loops) missed by template banks."

  # Takeaway Line
  - elementId: footer-takeaway
    elementType: text
    bounds: [185, 456, 735, 24]
    content:
      style: "$takeaway"
      text: "<b>Takeaway</b> · <b>What began as rare serendipity is now a daily detection stream powering statistical astronomy.</b>"

  # Sources Line
  - elementId: footer-sources
    elementType: text
    bounds: [185, 490, 680, 20]
    content:
      style: "$footer"
      text: "Sources: LVK Collaboration, GWTC-1/2/3, PRX 9, 031040; PRX 11, 021053; PRX 13, 041039 · GraceDB O4 Public Alerts"

  # Page Number
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [875, 490, 45, 20]
    content:
      style: "$footer"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "4"
